{:tier :glm-5.2, :verse 5, :comments ["<b>Among any swarming thing that would defile him.</b> By the measure fit to defile — כַּעֲדָשָׁה (Hagigah 11)." "<b>Or by a person.</b> A corpse." "<b>That would defile him.</b> By its measure to defile, and that is כַּזַּיִת (Oholot ch. 2)." "<b>For any of his defilement.</b> To include one who touches a zav, a zavah, a menstruant, and a woman after childbirth."], :book :leviticus, :voice :rashi, :lang :en, :chapter 22, :notes {}, :source-witnesses nil, :timestamp "2026-08-02T09:07:39.829658683Z", :translated-from :he, :model "glm-5.2"}